  "_review": "The rows flagged needs_primary_source were added to cover the European connection points a real JFK-LHR search actually returns. MCT, curfew and inter-terminal figures are curated from published airport and carrier data and are the right shape at roughly the right magnitude; each still wants checking against the airport's own published minimum connection time before a dollar figure built on it is shown to a stranger. AMS, BCN, CDG, EWR, JFK, LHR, LIS, MAD and MXP predate this and carry no flag. Deliberately NOT added: BOS, IAD, ATL, BOG, CMN, TLV and AUH - a JFK-LHR search returns connections through all of them and every one is outside the transatlantic scope, so they go on dropping."
}